      "content": "20. DOUBLE PREPOSITION ERRORS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uou6cy5"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Avoid double preposition errors: Transitive verbs like 'discuss', 'describe', 'reach', and 'order' do not take prepositions when followed directly by their object.",
        "Adjectives ending in '-ior' (senior, junior, superior, inferior) take 'to' instead of 'than'.",
        "Do not confuse 'Beside' (meaning next to) with 'Besides' (meaning in addition to)."
      ],
      "id": "0dfsebf"
    },
